---
import { ArrowLeft } from 'lucide-react';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer';
import Starfield from '../components/Starfield';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — ප්‍රභව Labs"
  description="What prabhavalabs.com collects, why it is collected, and how to remove it."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <Navbar client:load currentPath="/privacy" />

  <header class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 pb-12 pt-44 md:pt-52">
    <Starfield client:load density={70} />
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(124,111,212,0.1)_0%,_transparent_65%)]"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="mb-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/65 transition-colors hover:text-white"
      >
        <ArrowLeft size={14} /> Back home
      </a>
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-white/65">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white md:text-7xl">
        A small site with a <em class="italic text-white/65">small data footprint.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/65">
        Prabhava Labs does not run behavioural analytics, advertising trackers, or an account
        system. I collect one thing only when you choose to share it: your newsletter email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="px-6 pb-28">
    <article class="prose-dark mx-auto max-w-3xl border-t border-white/10 pt-12">
      <h2>Normal visits</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by Cloudflare, which may process standard network information such as
        your IP address to deliver pages and protect the service. Prabhava Labs does not copy that
        information into its own analytics database. The interactive globe uses a fixed set of
        public cities. It does not look up your location.
      </p>

      <h2>Newsletter subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        If you subscribe, the site stores your email address, the time you subscribed, and the
        source label <code>site-footer</code> in a Cloudflare D1 database. A hidden bot field and a
        short request limit help protect that form from abuse. No marketing profile is built from
        your address, and it is not sold or shared with advertisers.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
      <p>
        The public site does not set tracking cookies. It does not need local storage for ordinary
        reading. External links, including GitHub and X, have their own privacy practices once you
        leave this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Removal and questions</h2>
      <p>
        To unsubscribe or ask for your email to be removed, write to
        <a href="mailto:hello@prabhavalabs.com">hello@prabhavalabs.com</a> from the same address.
        This notice will be updated if the site starts collecting anything new.
      </p>

      <p><small>Last updated July 26, 2026.</small></p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer client:visible />
</Layout>
